sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as Web UI / CLI
    participant OPS as ops 目录
    participant APP as tasking 应用层
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant OB as outbox
    participant AN as analytics

    U->>UI: task.create（自然语言或命令）
    UI->>OPS: POST /api/ops/task.create
    OPS->>OPS: zod 校验 · 鉴权 · expectedVersion
    OPS->>APP: createTask(input)
    APP->>DB: BEGIN
    APP->>DB: INSERT task
    APP->>DB: INSERT op_log（同一事务）
    APP->>DB: INSERT outbox
    APP->>DB: COMMIT
    APP-->>OPS: Task DTO
    OPS-->>UI: { ok, data, meta }
    OB-->>AN: TaskCreated（异步投影）
    UI-->>U: 列表刷新 / CLI 输出 JSON
